# Compact instructions
Preserve: current task, files touched, decisions made, failing tests, exact errors, next steps.
Drop: raw tool output, resolved errors, exploratory reads, repeated logs.

# Token budget
Follow `.claude/rules/token-budget.md`.
- One task per session. Topic change → `/clear`.
- Set model + effort at the start. Do not switch mid-session.
- `@path` instead of Read when the path is known.
- 3+ files to investigate → Haiku/Explore subagent, return a summary only.
- Do not edit this file mid-session.
